  "help": {
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Quick Start",
        "icon": "🚀",
        "items": [
          "Open <code>ops_data.json</code> in VS Code or any text editor",
          "Edit only the <em>values</em> — do NOT rename any keys",
          "Save the file, then refresh the browser (<strong>F5</strong>)",
          "<code>ops_data.json</code> = data and KPIs (update every cycle); <code>dashboard_config.json</code> = labels, tabs, and layout (update rarely)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Monthly Update Checklist",
        "icon": "📋",
        "items": [
          "<strong>meta</strong> — update <code>period</code> (e.g. \"May 2026 (CW22)\"), <code>lastUpdated</code>, <code>reportDate</code>",
          "<strong>pulse.keyFlag</strong> — write a 1-2 sentence executive summary for the purple banner",
          "<strong>global</strong> — update portfolio totals (<code>sapTotal, nsTotal</code>), SLA composites, and deltas",
          "<strong>modules[]</strong> — for each module: update KPIs (<code>total</code>, <code>inc</code>, <code>sr</code>, <code>mttr</code>, <code>respSla</code>, <code>resolSla</code>, etc.)",
          "<strong>modules[].mttr</strong> — MTTR is wall-clock time (opened to resolved), includes On Hold periods; not a pure working-hours metric",
          "<strong>modules[].mom</strong> — shift array left, append this month's volume; keep 6 entries",
          "<strong>modules[].respSlaMom / resolSlaMom</strong> — same left-shift pattern; keep 6 entries",
          "<strong>modules[].priorityMeta / ageMeta</strong> — update percentages for distribution charts",
          "<strong>modules[].notes</strong> — update operational notes (supporting commentary per module)",
          "<strong>rfac.{moduleId}</strong> — update open counts, aging percentages, emergency changes",
          "<strong>prb.{moduleId}</strong> — update open counts, months-aging, known errors, oldest days",
          "<strong>actionItems[] / escalations[]</strong> — add/resolve items, change statuses, update due dates",
          "<strong>projects[] / continuousImprovement[]</strong> — update status, RAG, milestone dates",
          "<strong>headcount</strong> — update <code>sapAMS</code>, <code>sapProjects</code>, <code>nsAMS</code>, <code>nsProjects</code> FTE counts"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Allowed Values",
        "icon": "✅",
        "items": [
          "<strong>Status fields</strong>: <code>\"Open\"</code> | <code>\"In Progress\"</code> | <code>\"Closed\"</code> (actionItems) / <code>\"Resolved\"</code> (escalations)",
          "<strong>RAG colors</strong>: <code>\"GREEN\"</code> | <code>\"AMBER\"</code> | <code>\"RED\"</code> (case-sensitive)",
          "<strong>Boolean</strong>: <code>true</code> | <code>false</code>",
          "<strong>Percentages</strong>: 0–100 (e.g. <code>96.2</code> = 96.2%)",
          "<strong>Delta direction</strong>: negative = down (improvement), positive = up (deterioration)",
          "<strong>Domain</strong>: <code>\"SAP\"</code> or <code>\"NonERP\"</code> (per module)",
          "<strong>Project status</strong>: <code>\"Explore\"</code> | <code>\"Prepare\"</code> | <code>\"Realize\"</code> | <code>\"Deploy\"</code> | <code>\"Closed\"</code>",
          "<strong>CI status</strong>: <code>\"Planned\"</code> | <code>\"In Progress\"</code> | <code>\"Completed\"</code>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Module Data Fields",
        "icon": "📊",
        "items": [
          "Each module object has these key fields:",
          "<code>id</code> — unique key (e.g. <code>\"crm\"</code>, <code>\"scm\"</code>) — do NOT change",
          "<code>name</code> — display name (e.g. <code>\"CRM\"</code>, <code>\"SCM\"</code>)",
          "<code>domain</code> — <code>\"SAP\"</code> or <code>\"NonERP\"</code> determines which tab the module appears under",
          "<code>total</code> — total tickets received (INC + SR)",
          "<code>inc</code> / <code>sr</code> — incident vs service request split",
          "<code>resolved</code> / <code>netFlow</code> — resolved count and net flow (resolved - received)",
          "<code>respSla</code> / <code>resolSla</code> — response and resolution SLA compliance (%)",
          "<code>mttr</code> — mean time to resolve (hours)",
          "<code>reopenRate</code> — percentage of tickets reopened",
          "<code>firstFixRate</code> — percentage resolved on first touch",
          "<code>breachCount</code> / <code>nearMissCount</code> — SLA breaches and near-misses",
          "<code>escalationRate</code> — escalation rate per module",
          "<code>baseline</code> — baseline volume for \"vs Baseline\" comparison on module KPI strip"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Module Trend Arrays",
        "icon": "📈",
        "items": [
          "All MoM arrays follow a 6-element left-shift pattern:",
          "<code>mom</code> — volume trend (6 months, most recent last)",
          "<code>incMom</code> / <code>srMom</code> — incident and SR split trends",
          "<code>resolvedMom</code> / <code>netFlowMom</code> — resolution and net flow trends",
          "<code>backlogMom</code> — open backlog at month-end (6 months)",
          "<code>respSlaMom</code> / <code>resolSlaMom</code> — SLA % trends (6 months)",
          "To update: <strong>drop the first element</strong>, append the new month's value at the end",
          "Example: <code>[6, 8, 7, 9, 11, 10]</code> → remove 6 → append new value → <code>[8, 7, 9, 11, 10, NEW]</code>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Distribution Charts (Priority & Age)",
        "icon": "🎯",
        "items": [
          "<code>priority</code> — 4-element array; percentages for P1/P2, P3, P4, Unprioritised (must sum to 100)",
          "<code>age</code> — 4-element array; percentages for 0-3wk, 3-6wk, 6-10wk, >10wk (must sum to 100)",
          "<code>priorityMeta</code> — label + color + pct for each priority bucket",
          "<code>ageMeta</code> — label + color + pct for each age bucket",
          "Colors: <code>\"red\"</code>, <code>\"amber\"</code>, <code>\"green\"</code>, <code>\"blue\"</code>, <code>\"purple\"</code>, <code>\"muted\"</code>",
          "Keep <code>pct</code> values in sync between the array and the Meta objects"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Editing RFaC & PRB Aging",
        "icon": "📋",
        "items": [
          "RFaC data lives in <code>rfac.{moduleId}</code>:",
          "<code>openCount</code> — number of open Requests for Change",
          "<code>under8wPct</code> — % of RFCs open less than 8 weeks",
          "<code>under12wPct</code> — % of RFCs open less than 12 weeks",
          "<code>emergencyCount</code> — number of emergency changes this period",
          "<code>cycleTimeAvgDays</code> — average RFC cycle time in days",
          "<code>slaCompliant</code> — boolean: <code>true</code> / <code>false</code>",
          "—",
          "PRB data lives in <code>prb.{moduleId}</code>:",
          "<code>openCount</code> — number of open Problem Records",
          "<code>under3mPct</code> — % of PRBs open less than 3 months",
          "<code>under6mPct</code> — % of PRBs open less than 6 months",
          "<code>knownErrorCount</code> — number of Known Errors",
          "<code>oldestDays</code> — age of oldest open PRB in days"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Editing Action Items & Escalations",
        "icon": "📝",
        "items": [
          "<code>actionItems[]</code> — each item has:",
          "· <code>action</code> — description (first column, left-aligned)",
          "· <code>owner</code> — responsible person",
          "· <code>dueDate</code> — ISO date (e.g. <code>\"2026-06-06\"</code>)",
          "· <code>status</code> — <code>\"Open\"</code> | <code>\"In Progress\"</code> | <code>\"Closed\"</code>",
          "· <code>nextSteps</code> — next steps description (last column)",
          "—",
          "<code>escalations[]</code> — each item has:",
          "· <code>issue</code> — escalation title (first column, styled red)",
          "· <code>responsible</code> — responsible lead",
          "· <code>dueDate</code> — ISO date",
           "· <code>status</code> — <code>\"Open\"</code> | <code>\"Resolved\"</code>",
           "· <code>nextSteps</code> — resolution context / next steps",
           "—",
           "<code>appreciations[]</code> — each item has:",
           "· <code>module</code> — module <code>id</code> (e.g. <code>\"crm\"</code>)",
           "· <code>note</code> — kudos note text",
           "—",
           "<code>serviceOffers[]</code> — each item has:",
           "· <code>requester</code> — requester / subject line",
           "· <code>status</code> — <code>\"Proposed\"</code> | <code>\"In Review\"</code> | <code>\"Approved\"</code> | <code>\"In Progress\"</code> | <code>\"Implemented\"</code>",
           "· <code>reason</code> — scope / reason description",
           "· <code>nextSteps</code> — next steps"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Editing Projects & CI",
        "icon": "🚀",
        "items": [
          "<code>projects[]</code> — each project has:",
          "· <code>name</code> — project name",
          "· <code>ragOverall</code> — <code>\"GREEN\"</code> | <code>\"AMBER\"</code> | <code>\"RED\"</code>",
          "· <code>track</code> — program track (e.g. <code>\"Cloud Migration\"</code>)",
          "· <code>plannedGoLive</code> — go-live date",
          "· <code>status</code> — <code>\"Explore\"</code> | <code>\"Prepare\"</code> | <code>\"Realize\"</code> | <code>\"Deploy\"</code>",
          "· <code>currentStatus</code> — narrative status update",
          "—",
          "<code>continuousImprovement[]</code> — each CI item has:",
          "· <code>track</code> — category (e.g. <code>\"Automation\"</code>, <code>\"Process\"</code>)",
          "· <code>initiative</code> — initiative name (left-aligned)",
          "· <code>status</code> — <code>\"Planned\"</code> | <code>\"In Progress\"</code> | <code>\"Completed\"</code>",
          "· <code>effortSaved</code> — estimated/actual savings (styled green)",
          "· <code>plannedDeploy</code> — deployment date",
          "· <code>olympusLead</code> — Olympus program lead"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Updating Charts",
        "icon": "📊",
        "items": [
          "<strong>chart-overview-volume</strong> — updates from <code>global.sapTotal</code>, <code>global.nsTotal</code>, <code>months</code> array",
          "<strong>chart-overview-backlog</strong> — updates from <code>modules[].backlogMom</code> per domain (aggregated across SAP / NonERP)",
          "<strong>chart-trend-{module}</strong> — uses <code>modules[].mom</code> and <code>months</code> array",
          "<strong>chart-priority-{module}</strong> — uses <code>modules[].priorityMeta</code> percentages",
          "<strong>chart-age-{module}</strong> — uses <code>modules[].ageMeta</code> percentages",
          "<strong>chart-quality-mttr</strong> — compares <code>modules[].mttr</code> values across all modules",
          "<strong>chart-quality-reopen</strong> — compares <code>modules[].reopenRate</code> values across all modules",
          "<strong>chart-headcount-capacity</strong> — uses <code>headcount</code> FTE values and module totals"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
